Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.76,0:01:53.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(480,756)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Gambling Adoracalypse: Yumechi
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.40,0:02:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Nagumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.14,0:02:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, good morning to you, Ronko.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.54,0:02:32.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1289.6,361.6)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}An Akihabara
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.54,0:02:32.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1286.2,406)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}maid feud?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.54,0:02:32.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(713.6,310.4)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Wuv-Wuv Moonbeam
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.54,0:02:32.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(490,741.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Akihabara Maid Café Wiped Out
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.72,0:02:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although feuds between Akihabara maids\Nhave been relatively calm in recent years?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.05,0:02:35.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1289.6,361.6)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}An Akihabara
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.05,0:02:35.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1286.2,406)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}maid feud?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.05,0:02:35.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(832.2,250.6)\fnPapyrus\fs50}Wuv-Wuv Moonbeam
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.05,0:02:35.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(593.6,764.2)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}An Attack by an Affiliate of a Major Chain?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.10,0:02:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the incident last night is suspected to be\Npart of a long - That's Wuv Wuv Moonbeam.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.64,0:02:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you dudes really\Nsmashed things up a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.42,0:02:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, we sure did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.78,0:02:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think you went a little too far?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.80,0:02:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think the chief is okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.80,0:02:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.32,0:02:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.23,0:02:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The plan was to make one of those\Nrodents kill one of your piglets.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.54,0:02:55.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was needed in order to spark a dispute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.16,0:02:57.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wiping them out instead is unacceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.82,0:03:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you've created a huge problem for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.10,0:03:00.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.66,0:03:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay still.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.57,0:03:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now don't move. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.36,0:03:07.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.52,0:03:08.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.50,0:03:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you value your pigsty of a life,\NI suggest you pay me what you owe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.90,0:03:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice shot!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.97,0:03:18.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(833.6,871.4)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.18,0:03:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait. Oink!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.06,0:03:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.18,0:03:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you like to order a drink first?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.14,0:03:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's business as usual?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.24,0:03:29.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even after what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.30,0:03:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For you, Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.56,0:03:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I recommend the first pigsty visit lunch\Nor the heartthrob ginger pork lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.12,0:03:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But with the pigsty lunch,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.78,0:03:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll get to take a photo with a\Ncouple of our cute little piglets.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.00,0:03:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Yumechi does scary\Nstuff behind the scenes, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.86,0:03:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's the piggly jiggly rice\Nomelet you ordered master.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.64,0:03:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It comes with the ketchup doodle service
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.46,0:03:53.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, please allow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.80,0:03:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She shot people like it was nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.42,0:04:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look mad, pale, everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.16,0:04:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I just didn't sleep\Nvery well last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.42,0:04:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go for a stroll?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.36,0:04:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by a stroll?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.92,0:04:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the maid version of a stroll.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.68,0:04:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the cafe!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.92,0:04:37.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.88,0:04:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oinky-doink cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.94,0:04:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to Oinky-doink cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.16,0:04:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come in, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.60,0:04:45.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.51,0:04:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't this my chance\Nto run away from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.58,0:04:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, pig face!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.84,0:04:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think you could just hand those out on\Nour turf for your pathetic little store?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.82,0:04:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might get yourself killed, meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.84,0:04:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I was told our group had\Nproper permission to hand these...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.04,0:05:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe so, but you're at the\Nfriggin' bottom of the heap, piggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.74,0:05:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't mean you can go\Naround being all cocky, Underly!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.58,0:05:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.38,0:05:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oinky-doink cafe!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.24,0:05:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oinky-doink cafe!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.84,0:05:18.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giving out flyers is\Npretty tough, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.30,0:05:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And most people are in such a hurry,\Nthey don't even bother to take one!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.28,0:05:24.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.22,0:05:25.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm definitely still learning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.28,0:05:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you must be new to\Nthe maid's stroll! I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.70,0:05:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our place is tiny, though. That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.82,0:05:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our cafe is pretty small as well. It is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.96,0:05:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.48,0:05:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm from Invader Café Destron.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.46,0:05:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Nerula.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.94,0:05:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm Nagomi from Oinky Doink Café.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.58,0:05:45.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's very nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.42,0:05:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not affiliated,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.62,0:05:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but as fellow maids, we\Nneed to do the best we can,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.60,0:05:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even though the skirmishes\Ncan be pretty rough at times.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.76,0:05:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do the skirmishes and other scary stuff\Nhappen a lot at the maid cafes? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.30,0:06:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, of course, violence has\Nalways been part of the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.86,0:06:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But being a maid isn't all bad, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.58,0:06:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You put your trust in your cafe and your\Ngroup, and they look after you in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.08,0:06:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world of maid cafes is like a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.96,0:06:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, you get to wear a cute uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.42,0:06:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.00,0:06:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'll keep at it\Nfor a little longer then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.98,0:06:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.22,0:06:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think dream big go go, okay? I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.28,0:06:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Nerula.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:25.16,0:06:27.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(140.6,690.8)\fnPapyrus\fs50}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.72,0:06:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm back, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.42,0:06:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, someone seems a lot happier. I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.64,0:06:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to dream pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.38,0:06:35.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,True that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.29,0:06:37.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta dream pig. Go, go. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.88,0:06:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey there, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.36,0:06:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.46,0:06:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This cafe is going out of business.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.34,0:06:45.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.38,0:06:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bronco, I need you to close\Nout and make it quick, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.30,0:06:49.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.24,0:06:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell us what's going on, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.40,0:06:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you really don't\Nwant to hear about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.60,0:06:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell us. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.10,0:06:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please say you'll lend us money.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.02,0:07:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much money we talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.82,0:07:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A lot would be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.10,0:07:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A lot, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.38,0:07:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As much as I would like to lend you a\Nlot, I'd need some guaranteed collateral.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.04,0:07:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of collateral?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.70,0:07:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.32,0:07:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, some land or a building?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.80,0:07:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, how about our cafe? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.12,0:07:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's too funny. You sold it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.40,0:07:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sold our cafe?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.50,0:07:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's collateral!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.32,0:07:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you know what that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.44,0:07:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get it all back in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.46,0:07:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, manager, this is what we can offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.10,0:07:32.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doesn't look like a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.06,0:07:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you looking to get more?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.36,0:07:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sure wouldn't hurt to\Nhave a lot more. Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.08,0:07:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know a wise way to invest that money.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.36,0:07:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could even double it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.62,0:07:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a members-only\Nclub called Maid Casino.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.46,0:07:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.50,0:07:47.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.41,0:07:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do I look like a sucker to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.78,0:07:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it involves maids, it's gotta be shady.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.62,0:07:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what everybody thinks right,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.26,0:07:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's actually totally\Nsafe and legal and you can
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.06,0:07:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,increase your cash while\Nhaving fun It's a win-win.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.82,0:08:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make money.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.10,0:08:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course you will a lot of\Nmaids are regular customers
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.60,0:08:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can take you right away\Nif you'd like to try it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.60,0:08:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maid casino wait you really went?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.16,0:08:25.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.36,0:08:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least I'm still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.84,0:08:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.28,0:08:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize how\Nprecious this cafe is?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.70,0:08:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's more important to a\Nmaid than her own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.96,0:08:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You realize I did it for all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.14,0:08:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will never know what\Nit's like to have to
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.12,0:08:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gamble for the sake of\Neveryone's well-being.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.38,0:08:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.29,0:08:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.28,0:08:43.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.19,0:08:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is going to\Nshut down as easy as that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.16,0:08:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're so fucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.54,0:08:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.66,0:08:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're definitely screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.08,0:08:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chief, I'm done closing\Nout the register. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.06,0:08:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.62,0:08:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got the proceeds from\Nworking our asses off right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.66,0:09:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You already spent the day\Ngambling, though, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.32,0:09:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With that little money?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.56,0:09:02.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.47,0:09:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you assume that it's\Nimpossible, it will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.74,0:09:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Self-doubt leads to failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.02,0:09:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.06,0:09:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's say it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.12,0:09:09.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.03,0:09:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.95,0:09:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can if we try. Now let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.28,0:09:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what should we do right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.76,0:09:16.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know the answer, right, Nagomi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.16,0:09:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.08,0:09:24.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My horoscope was totes-ma-goats today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.96,0:09:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This'll be a cinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.16,0:09:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gambling losses can only be\Nearned back with gambling.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.90,0:09:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is where it all begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.34,0:09:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our epic comeback.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.34,0:09:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hit a jackpot straight to your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.12,0:09:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Maid Casino.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.32,0:09:42.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.23,0:09:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.15,0:09:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, where do you think we should start?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.24,0:09:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.66,0:09:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.80,0:09:48.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.56,0:09:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um as if i'd give you any\Nshe lost all that money
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.34,0:09:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and now she's back is she\Nan idiot so do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.60,0:10:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can bring more money\Nout of her no need to i
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.00,0:10:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,already got hold of her\Nmaid cafe hey wait there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.70,0:10:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Might be something else worth taking check\Nit out garbage we can turn into cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.78,0:10:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.10,0:10:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this your first time at our casino?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.98,0:10:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.36,0:10:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, these slot machines\Nover here are great for beginners.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.68,0:10:36.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.64,0:10:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's very kind of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.06,0:10:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take your time, and please enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.70,0:10:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.72,0:10:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how these\Nwork, but I can dream pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.90,0:10:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.56,0:10:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, did I win?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.42,0:10:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're doing good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.12,0:10:52.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.03,0:10:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems that way, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.94,0:10:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So how is everybody else doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.46,0:11:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, baby, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.16,0:11:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, three potential bingos!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.16,0:11:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like everyone's doing so well,\Nit's time to make our first move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.38,0:11:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Lucky, I bet that's\Nenough for the cafe!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.92,0:11:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great, Chief, I'm so happy,\Nlet's wrap it up here and get back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.52,0:11:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you want to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.74,0:11:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gambling's no different\Nfrom how we experience life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.48,0:11:34.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can lose and can get\Nlaughed at and ridiculed,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.30,0:11:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but what you can't do is run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.78,0:11:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Chief, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.46,0:11:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did good, Piglet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.14,0:11:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.34,0:11:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boinky-doink!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.25,0:11:47.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, we should rake in enough\Nmoney to pay those Creatureland creeps!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.54,0:11:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You lost too, Ronco? Regretfully so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.24,0:11:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're completely out of money now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.32,0:12:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mistresses, are you enjoying yourselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.50,0:12:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the dealer over at the\NSuperDuper Poker Table,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.30,0:12:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm here to let you know that\Na new game is about to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.06,0:12:09.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Porker?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.97,0:12:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, poker.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.66,0:12:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the game with the highest\Nstakes here at our casino.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.84,0:12:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's the minimum Baan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.46,0:12:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way we have enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.10,0:12:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't there another way we can play?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.82,0:12:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.18,0:12:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seeing as you're all\Nsuch hard-working maids,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.56,0:12:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could suggest a way to play\Nwithout having enough chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.28,0:12:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A suggestion?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.26,0:12:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.17,0:12:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing drastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.09,0:12:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just pledging your maid\Nfutures as collateral.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.30,0:12:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pledging our future? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.80,0:12:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I don't want to go! Please!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:35.32,0:12:39.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(667.4,648.4)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Bound for the Octopus Room
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.08,0:12:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, babe, you won't do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.88,0:12:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything you want! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.06,0:12:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to go! No!\NDon't! Don't take me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.04,0:12:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way it works is\Nyou'll pledge the money
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.02,0:12:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're going to make in\Nthe future as collateral,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.06,0:12:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it's safe with zero risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.28,0:12:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh... We'll do it! Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.66,0:12:54.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't do that! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.28,0:12:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.24,0:12:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Sheepon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.54,0:12:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we can't go home like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.32,0:12:59.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.23,0:13:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The real deal starts now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.20,0:13:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it before we even started.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.14,0:13:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This way, mistresses.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.60,0:13:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll escort you to the poker area.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.48,0:13:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.50,0:13:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Much appreciated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.44,0:13:13.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to think that maybe everyone\Nat the oinky-doink is pretty messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.06,0:13:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you assume it's impossible, it will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.90,0:13:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Self-doubt only leads to\Nfailure. Be confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.22,0:13:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what do you think we should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.00,0:13:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know the answer, Nagomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.16,0:13:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.70,0:13:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poker is about reading the\Nother player's thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.22,0:13:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The key is how well\Nyou can read them. Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.12,0:13:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So your value as a maid translates\Ninto the number of chips you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.82,0:13:40.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.73,0:13:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My lifetime income is pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.28,0:13:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I have\Nless than Ronko or Nogomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.60,0:13:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you have way too much over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.50,0:13:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.62,0:13:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This mistress is making a move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.60,0:13:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's going all in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.80,0:13:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a super duper chance! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.06,0:13:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, show your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.02,0:13:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, the suspense! And open!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.08,0:14:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three of a kind. Two\Nof a kind. Three, nine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.86,0:14:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I had a pretty\Ngood shot with that
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.16,0:14:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hand three nine can't\Nbeat a five-five I guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.80,0:14:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid piglet!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.80,0:14:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever, that's one down if you have no\Nchips left to make your way over there?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:18.75,0:14:20.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(728.2,558)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Bound for the Octopus Room
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.30,0:14:20.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.30,0:14:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.04,0:14:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.24,0:14:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.52,0:14:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, is this the winning hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.26,0:14:41.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.90,0:14:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happens if we lose all the chips?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.42,0:14:45.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to the rumors?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.36,0:14:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up in the bitter cold of the Bering\NSea, You catch craps without rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.34,0:14:55.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, they wear you down until no\None would ever recognize you as a maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.04,0:14:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For real? Too funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.04,0:15:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.40,0:15:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for the next game to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.78,0:15:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then allow me to go first. Hey, Ronko.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.68,0:15:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would you do if I asked you to\Nentrust me with all of your poker chips?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.82,0:15:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.08,0:15:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both my chips and my life.\NThank you. That means a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.48,0:15:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like Yamichi's\Ngonna use Ronko's chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.42,0:15:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then if she loses, that\Nmeans we're done for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.12,0:15:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got this, piglet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.54,0:15:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.45,0:15:31.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The chief believes in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.38,0:15:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's the last one, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.76,0:15:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, where should we ship off\Nthose not-so-stellar pork butts?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.98,0:15:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First betting round is in play.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.64,0:15:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A raise.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.94,0:15:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With this move, this mistress here has\Ndoubled the wager, increasing the pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.14,0:15:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a super duper big chance! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.34,0:16:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That customer's awfully\Nconfident with her hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.10,0:16:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Makes me want to step up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.48,0:16:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That should make things interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.08,0:16:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a dumb maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.86,0:16:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have zero chances of winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.42,0:16:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.16,0:16:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check, please. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.24,0:16:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, it's the final betting round.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.64,0:16:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to raise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.38,0:16:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That increases the wager eightfold.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.08,0:16:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the super duper last\Nand final chance. Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.52,0:16:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yumiichi, you've got this, I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.30,0:16:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what you're doing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.94,0:16:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.82,0:16:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She could lose everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.36,0:16:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear the Bering Sea gets\Ndown to minus 30 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.20,0:16:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say if you fall in the\Nwater, you die in three seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.86,0:16:53.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.77,0:16:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no freaking way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.78,0:16:55.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, dang it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.88,0:16:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yumiichi had today's best horoscope.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.68,0:16:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought for sure she'd win.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.28,0:17:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.68,0:17:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.34,0:17:03.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your turn, mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.64,0:17:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't fold, it'll\Nbe game over right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.86,0:17:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm all in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.96,0:17:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe she went for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.58,0:17:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that wise to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.92,0:17:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe she's all like, whatevs. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.06,0:17:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way she can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.44,0:17:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is she going for it with that hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.32,0:17:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, please show your\Nhands in a clockwise direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.42,0:17:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Mistress, please show us your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.60,0:17:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't call yourself a maid\Nwith that level of service.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.28,0:17:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you think I wouldn't\Nnotice what you were doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.96,0:17:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,During the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.92,0:17:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you never deal out the\Ntop card to your associate
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.90,0:18:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,over there in order to\Ncheat your way to a win.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.38,0:18:01.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.29,0:18:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dealer's cheating?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.21,0:18:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.24,0:18:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not fair at all, hustler.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.70,0:18:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better go back to your\Nhometown and start over, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.12,0:18:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won some and lost some,\Nso we wouldn't ever catch on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.20,0:18:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when you're dealt a winning hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.60,0:18:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you have a bad habit of always\Nfiddling around with your glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.86,0:18:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see right through your tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.92,0:18:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That confident bet was a bluff\Nto dupe me out of my winnings.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.16,0:18:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't touch your glasses this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.14,0:18:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means I have the\Nwinning hand this round.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.24,0:18:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mistress, what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.46,0:18:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yumechi! Good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.84,0:18:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew you could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.92,0:18:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.94,0:18:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A full house and a full house.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.36,0:18:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did Yumechi just win the game?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.44,0:18:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, she didn't. She lost. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.58,0:19:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.74,0:19:10.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a good game, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.68,0:19:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow, what a great game.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.26,0:19:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So very moving. Asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.54,0:19:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then, please come over this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.94,0:19:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.24,0:19:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, piggies, you'll\Nbe departing at 2100.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.16,0:19:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ain't going on no boat\Nto go crab catching.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.42,0:19:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My cafe, give me back my cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.24,0:19:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You damn whining, pig turd.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.18,0:19:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to delay our\Nshipment port for brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.32,0:19:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time is money in this business.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.18,0:19:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have enough\Nsense to know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.82,0:19:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think you crappy maids know better than\Ngarbage can run a cafe here at Akiva,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.94,0:19:40.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of all places?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.85,0:19:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe in like 50,000 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.30,0:19:55.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.26,0:19:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's too funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.70,0:20:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be taking back our cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.52,0:20:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You lost wine, so get back in the cage!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.28,0:20:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.84,0:20:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who swindled us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.64,0:20:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're the ones struggling\Nand putting it hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.12,0:20:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honest work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.62,0:20:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.60,0:20:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's finish this shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.98,0:20:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gosh, I haven't used a gun in ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.94,0:20:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.16,0:20:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, get back here, pigs!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.14,0:20:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make you maids in hell with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.12,0:20:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to send you to hell.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:23.05,0:21:28.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(491.2,420.8)\fnPapyrus\fs50}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.06,0:21:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was an explosion last\Nnight at a building in Akihabara.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.36,0:21:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to investigators, it was due\Nto a skirmish in an underground casino.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.56,0:21:31.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(536.4,745)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Building Explodes in Akihabara
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.56,0:21:35.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1233.8,309.4)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Trouble in an
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.56,0:21:35.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1235.4,347)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}underground casino?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.46,0:21:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This establishment had close\Nconnections to a loan shark business.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.81,0:21:35.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(617.8,717.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Underground Casino Linked to Loan Shark Busted
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.98,0:21:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.94,0:21:37.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's really awful stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.72,0:21:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, it's not all\Nthat unusual these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.30,0:21:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That explosion was a little too risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.94,0:21:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ours from fireworks looks like\Nwe're celebrating New Year's early.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.94,0:21:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you know, the loan\Nsharks got in the cafe safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.30,0:21:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I did good, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.06,0:21:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, we're still behind on our dues.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.02,0:21:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure someone is going to come\Nby soon asking for it the soy sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.46,0:21:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May I take it, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.34,0:22:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.46,0:22:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to calm down at\Nleast I'm still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.04,0:22:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today and tomorrow are all good.
