Dialogue: 2,0:22:24.70,0:22:29.70,ED Lyrics - Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.6\fad(200,200)}Kyou mo ashita mo moe moe kyun
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.40,0:22:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all good at the house.
