Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.02,0:22:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all good at the house.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.84,0:22:41.97,ED Lyrics - English,,0,0,0,,{\1a&HF1&\blur6\fad(200,200)}That's the sort of life I lead
Dialogue: 2,0:22:36.84,0:22:41.97,ED Lyrics - English,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.8\fad(200,200)}That's the sort of life I lead
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.84,0:22:41.97,ED Lyrics - Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\1a&HF3&\blur4\fad(200,200)}Sorega atai no ikizama sa
Dialogue: 2,0:22:36.84,0:22:41.97,ED Lyrics - Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.6\fad(200,200)}Sorega atai no ikizama sa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.14,0:22:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the truth of our life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.48,0:22:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not stupid to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.17,0:22:51.77,ED Lyrics - English,,0,0,0,,{\1a&HF1&\blur6\fad(200,200)}Mock me, and you just might bleed
Dialogue: 2,0:22:43.17,0:22:51.77,ED Lyrics - English,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.8\fad(200,200)}Mock me, and you just might bleed
